M1) deltas only, no sequence numbers 18 9.44% 0.000% 9.5 MB.

498
00:34:55.119 --> 00:35:04.933
M2) sequenced deltas + retransmit on gap 0 0.00% 0.334% 9.6 MB.

499
00:35:05.213 --> 00:35:22.962
M3) sequenced deltas + 1 s snapshots, resync on gap 0 0.00% 7.838% 10.9 MB. then an incremental feed without sequence numbers can't know it missed something: one. lost update leaves a price.

500
00:35:23.242 --> 00:35:24.757
The rest is in the chapter.

501
